<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Float Sets (1 of 2)</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

WARM-UP:
-30min building from Z1 to Z2

MAIN SET:
- 4x4min @ 112% FTP (Z5+, RPE 8-9), 2:30 recovery @ 83% FTP (Z3, RPE 5-6)
-Cadence: 90-100rpm (race cadence)
-Position: Drops for efforts, hoods for recovery

COOL-DOWN:
-24min easy spin Z1-Z2

PROGRESSION:
-Level 4/6: Progressive - Increased challenge, refining execution
-Compressed recovery. Fatigue accumulates faster — manage early reps conservatively

EXECUTION:
-Focus on consistent effort and good form throughout.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="1800" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.70" />
    <IntervalsT Repeat="4" OnDuration="240" OnPower="1.12" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95" OffDuration="150" OffPower="0.83" />
    <Cooldown Duration="1440" PowerLow="0.70" PowerHigh="0.50" />
  </workout>
</workout_file>